    "studyOverviewHtml": "<p>This course is comprised of the following qualifications:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>NCFE Level 2 Certificate in Sport (Sport, Exercise and Fitness)\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Level 2 Certificate in Supporting Learning in Physical Education, School Sport and Physical Activity\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Award in Community Sports Leadership\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>These qualifications will cover topics such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Anatomy & Physiology</li>\n\t<li>Fitness, Coaching</li>\n\t<li>Health & Safety</li>\n\t<li>Psychology and much more</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>There is also a wide range of enrichment activities linked to the course in and around the local community. These provide you with further experience and opportunities to develop your sports leadership and employability skills.\u00a0</p>",
    "courseForMeHtml": "<p>Kickstart Your Sports Career\u00a0at Chelmsford College!\u00a0If\u00a0you are passionate about sports and dreaming of a future in the industry, our Level 2 Sports course is your gateway to a thrilling career in sports!</p>\n\n<p><strong>Here\u2019s what\u2019s in store for you:\u00a0</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Hands-On Experience: </strong>Dive into the world of sports with practical and theoretical training that will make you industry ready.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li><strong>Explore Human Performance: </strong>Discover the science behind peak athletic performance and how you can apply it to excel in your sport.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li><strong>Fitness Industry Insights:</strong> Get insider knowledge about the fitness industry, from cutting-edge training techniques to the latest trends.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li><strong>Sports in the UK: </strong>Learn how different organisations and agencies provide sports opportunities across the country.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li><strong>Coaching Qualifications:</strong> Earn not one, but two industry-recognised coaching qualifications that will boost your CV and open doors to exciting job prospects.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li><strong>Real-World Experience:</strong> Gain valuable work experience within the sports industry, making you a standout candidate for future employers.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Join us and turn your passion for sports into a successful career. Enrol now and start your journey to becoming a sports industry pro!\u00a0</p>",
