    "progression": "Level Up: Progress to the NCFE Level 3 Sport and Physical Activity (Sport & Exercise Science) course to deepen your knowledge and skills.\u00a0\n\nGet Paid While You Learn: Consider progressing to an apprenticeship to gain hands-on experience and earn while you train.\u00a0\n\nKickstart Your Career: Open doors to potential employment in the sports sector, including:\u00a0\n\nCoaching Positions: Supported by National Governing Body qualifications.\u00a0\n\nFitness Industry: From personal training to gym management.\u00a0\n\nSport and Recreation Centres: Work in vibrant environments where sports and leisure meet.\u00a0\n\nOverall, by joining us, you can start to transform your love for sports into a rewarding career path!",
    "employabilityHtml": "<p><strong>Level Up: </strong>Progress to the NCFE Level 3 Sport and Physical Activity (Sport & Exercise Science) course to deepen your knowledge and skills.\u00a0</p>\n\n<p><strong>Get Paid While You Learn:</strong> Consider progressing to an apprenticeship to gain hands-on experience and earn while you train.\u00a0</p>\n\n<p><strong>Kickstart Your Career: </strong>Open doors to potential employment in the sports sector, including:\u00a0</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Coaching Positions: Supported by National Governing Body qualifications.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Fitness Industry: From personal training to gym management.\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Sport and Recreation Centres: Work in vibrant environments where sports and leisure meet.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Overall, by joining us, you can start to transform your love for sports into a rewarding career path!\u00a0</p>",
    "additionalQuals": "At Chelmsford College we are dedicated to helping all our learners achieve their ambitions and we acknowledge that in order to do well, some of our learners may need extra support in Maths and/or English.\n\nPlease note that individual Level 2 literacy and numeracy may not be equivalent to a full GCSE qualification. We provide specialist teaching as a compulsory part of the study programme for all learners who have not achieved a grade 4 at GCSE in these subjects.\n\nWe also work closely with stakeholders, including CIMSPA and Billericay Town Football Club, to improve our sport programmes based on their feedback, for example adding, CIMSPA-accredited CPD modules to align with industry needs.",
