    "employabilityHtml": "<p>Skills in a scientific subject are transferable and highly sought after by employers. Upon successful completion, depending on your goals for what is next, you may progress to higher education, employment, including in digital forensic investigation or to a degree apprenticeship.</p>\n\n<p>Many learners progress to university, and this course is suitable for further studies in criminology, psychology, forensic investigation, forensic science, and policing studies. Learners may also apply for Border Force, Police and Armed Services.</p>",
