    "studyOverviewHtml": "<p>This course is designed to help students gain a comprehensive understanding of painting and decorating by covering a range of essential topics and units. These units are essential to have a solid foundation in painting and decorating and will also equip you with the necessary skills that employers often look for when hiring individuals in this industry.</p>\n\n<p>When studying Level 1 Painting and Decorating, you can expect your units to include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Health and safety in construction</li>\n\t<li>The construction industry</li>\n\t<li>Environmental awareness and sustainability in construction</li>\n\t<li>The handling, moving\u00a0and storing of\u00a0resources</li>\n\t<li>Erect and dismantle access equipment or working platforms</li>\n\t<li>Personal wellbeing in construction</li>\n\t<li>Construction principles</li>\n\t<li>Further skills for painting and decorating</li>\n</ul>",
    "courseForMeHtml": "<p>Are you someone who wants to leave a lasting legacy and make a practical difference in people's lives? Do you have an eye for detail, a passion for learning, and an interest in the field of construction? If so, we recommend considering our Painting and Decorating Diploma.</p>\n\n<p>In this course, you will gain hands-on experience in all aspects of painting and decorating. You will learn the skills and techniques needed to make homes more inviting, create striking decorative effects, and improve existing buildings. With practical training and expert guidance, you will develop a keen eye for detail and a deep understanding of the tools and materials needed to do the job right.</p>\n\n<p>Upon completing our Painting and Decorating course, you will have the opportunity to start a rewarding career in the construction industry. You will be equipped with the knowledge and skills needed to work on a wide variety of projects. Whether you choose to work for a construction company or start your own business, the possibilities are endless.</p>",
    "eligibilityHtml": "<p>Commitment to working in the construction industry.\u00a0</p>",
