    "progression": "Upon completion, if you're wish to progress with further study, this could be by enrolling on the following courses:\n\nLevel 2 Diploma in Painting & Decorating full time.\n\nAlternatively, if you're wishing to enter employment, career opportunities may include employment in the construction, painting, and decorating industry or\u00a0an apprenticeship.",
    "employabilityHtml": "<p>Upon completion, if you're wish to progress with further study, this could be by enrolling on the following courses:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Level 2 Diploma in Painting & Decorating full time.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Alternatively, if you're wishing to enter employment, career opportunities may include employment in the construction, painting, and decorating industry or\u00a0an apprenticeship.</p>",
