    "courseForMeHtml": "<p>The Life Skills pathway is designed specifically for students with Special Educational Needs and/or Disabilities (SEND)\u00a0working at pre-entry to entry level 2. Its purpose is to help them develop their life skills and independence, so they can successfully transition into adulthood. This comprehensive course content explores various aspects that are essential for advancing yourself both personally and professionally, such as social skills, communication techniques, and practical abilities for daily living and employment readiness.</p>",
