    "studyOverviewHtml": "<p>You will undertake a series of core units to develop a range of skills including, organisation, team working and research skills. You will be introduced to different disabilities, lifestyles, and support needs of clients, which will enable you to work effectively with a diverse range of people.</p>\n\n<p>You will learn and carry out activities to develop social and emotional needs, about healthy eating, and how to plan safe environments to create a nurturing and supportive environment.\u00a0</p>",
    "courseForMeHtml": "<p>If you're not sure if you are interested in health and social care or childcare courses, we have the perfect course for you. This course will introduce you to the skills and qualities required to work in the fields of health and social care or with children. Throughout the course, you will have the opportunity to gain in-depth knowledge about these areas and develop essential skills that are highly valued and often required in the workforce.</p>\n\n<p>Additionally, you may have the opportunity to put your learning into practice by undertaking work experience in a professional setting. This will provide you with hands-on experience to add to your CV and allow you to explore different career options.?\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
