    "feesHtml": "",
    "additionalFees": "Uniform of Polo shirts\u00a0 (approximately \u00a39 each) and Sweatshirt\u00a0 (approximately \u00a312 each) to be purchased.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nUniform is to be worn in college and at placement\u00a0\n\nDBS approximately \u00a350\u00a0\n\nYou may be required to purchase course text books which are essential for the completion of your studies.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nEnrichment activities throughout the course to be paid for as necessary",
    "additionalFeesHtml": "<ul>\n\t<li>Uniform of Polo shirts\u00a0 (approximately \u00a39 each) and Sweatshirt\u00a0 (approximately \u00a312 each) to be purchased.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Uniform is to be worn in college and at placement\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>DBS approximately \u00a350\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>You may be required to purchase course text books which are essential for the completion of your studies.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Enrichment activities throughout the course to be paid for as necessary\u00a0</li>\n</ul>",
