    "progression": "On successful completion of this Level 2\u00a0course, including your placement experience and maths and English Language grades 4-9, you will be considered for progression onto the T Level in Education and Childcare (Early Years Educator pathway, Level 3) or onto another Level 3\u00a0course.\n\nIf you\u2019d prefer to go straight into employment, it may be possible to go into employment as a Level 2 practitioner. Additionally, another option (if you have the required English and maths grades) is to look into undertaking an apprenticeship.",
    "employabilityHtml": "<p>On successful completion of this Level 2\u00a0course, including your placement experience and maths and English Language grades 4-9, you will be considered for progression onto the T Level in Education and Childcare (Early Years Educator pathway, Level 3) or onto another Level 3\u00a0course.</p>\n\n<p>If you\u2019d prefer to go straight into employment, it may be possible to go into employment as a Level 2 practitioner. Additionally, another option (if you have the required English and maths grades) is to look into undertaking an apprenticeship.</p>",
    "additionalQuals": "If you have GCSE Maths and English at grade 3, you will be required to study GCSE English and Maths.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nWe also work closely with stakeholders, including Dovedale Nursery, to improve our early years programmes based on their feedback. As a result, we've added paediatric first aid and infant mental health training as additional modules to align with industry needs.",
