    "employabilityHtml": "<p>Within the workplace, you can progress onto roles that might include:\u00a0</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Advertising and Media Executive\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Digital Marketer\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>E-commerce Manager\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Events Manager\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Fundraiser\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Marketing Assistant\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Marketing Officer</li>\n\t<li>Marketing Manager\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Marketing Researcher\u00a0</li>\n\t<li>Public Relations Manager\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Within education you can progress onto degree options which include Business Marketing, Business Finance or other similar pathways.\u00a0</p>\n\n<p>Within Apprenticeships, you can progress onto Digital Marketer or other similar pathways.\u00a0</p>",
