    "employabilityHtml": "<p>The BTEC Level 3 IT is equivalent to up to three A Levels, making it a strong route to university, higher apprenticeships, or direct employment.</p>\n\n<p>Graduates can pursue careers in:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Software development</li>\n\t<li>Web and games design</li>\n\t<li>IT support and technical roles</li>\n\t<li>Cyber security</li>\n\t<li>Business analysis</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The course is also a stepping stone to further study in computing, IT, or related fields at university.</p>",
