    "courseForMeHtml": "<p>This Level 3 Diploma and Extended Diploma in Performing and Production Arts is designed to provide learners with the knowledge, skills and understanding necessary to access and progress to degree level study or employment in the performing arts.</p>\n\n<p>It provides an opportunity for those who have an interest in the performing arts to explore, develop and test their creativity within a qualification structure which is stimulating, demanding and provides a supportive transition from general to more specialised study.</p>\n\n<p>By the end of this course, learners will have a critical and contextual awareness of different perspectives and approaches within performing and production arts. Through exploring character design, performance skills, production techniques, scriptwriting and costume construction, you will gain a well-rounded skillset for higher education or entry into the creative industries.</p>\n\n<p>This course gives learners a hands-on introduction to the world of theatre production, from acting and performance to costume or prop design and technical theatre. Designed to mirror the full theatre pipeline, it helps learners discover their strengths across creative and technical roles through group projects. With real-world projects, external workshops, guest speakers and partnerships with local theatres and arts organisations, learners gain valuable experience and industry connections.</p>",
